SUMMARY:Eclipse 2026
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Julie Slack\n\nMeet at the Wyche Bus Stop (not sure why
  Strava doesn't give this option!) \n\nPartial eclipse will be at its maxim
 um (and near total) at 19:12 \n(The next total solar eclipse in the UK will
  be 23/09/2090.)\n\nPlan to set off from the Wyche at 18:30 just after the 
 eclipse begins. Walk - run strategy. \n\nPrior to that will run a middle hi
 ll loop setting off promptly at 17:15 - usual steady run walking hills as r
 equired. \n\nFeel free to join at either point.\n\nRun ends on arrival at W
 orcestershire Beacon so please be prepared to make own way back down as and
  when you wish. \n\nHopefully it will be a clear evening so we get maximum 
 effect from the eclipse. \n\nH&S - runners to make own preparations for saf
 e viewing. \n\nhttps://www.timeanddate.com/eclipse/in/uk\n\nAny questions (
 not scientific please) \nLiRF: Julie Slack [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView 
 on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/352004530749769
 6626\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Sun\, 9 Aug @ 8:59 AM
